            "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > As scientists predicted, the Milky Way collided with the Andromeda galaxy. However, their calculations were incorrect, and the collision occurred much earlier. In the year 3521, during this cataclysm, the solar system was completely ejected from the Milky Way by gravitational forces and sucked into the black hole formed by the collision of the Milky Way and Andromeda. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Description</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Starship Annihilators! A classic vertical scrolling shooter. Includes 10 levels and 10 bosses. You will have several power-ups for weapon modification. In each level, you will fight different enemies, including those with both mild and extreme levels of danger! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achievements </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trading Cards </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A retro-style game that will transport you to the 90s </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controller support </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hardcore time-killing gameplay</p></li></ul>",
            "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > As scientists predicted, the Milky Way collided with the Andromeda galaxy. However, their calculations were incorrect, and the collision occurred much earlier. In the year 3521, during this cataclysm, the solar system was completely ejected from the Milky Way by gravitational forces and sucked into the black hole formed by the collision of the Milky Way and Andromeda. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Description</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Starship Annihilators! A classic vertical scrolling shooter. Includes 10 levels and 10 bosses. You will have several power-ups for weapon modification. In each level, you will fight different enemies, including those with both mild and extreme levels of danger! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achievements </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trading Cards </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A retro-style game that will transport you to the 90s </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controller support </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hardcore time-killing gameplay</p></li></ul>",
            "short_description": "A classic style vertical scrolling-shooter. Includes 10 levels and 10 boss enemies. You will have several power-ups for weapon modification. Within each level, you will face different enemies, among which will vary from low to extreme levels of threat!",
