                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Not very fun. To reach the final stage, you essentially have to play nearly perfectly. Health drops are extremely rare, and dying and restarting a level only restores the health you had when you first entered it. This means that after just 2–3 levels, you're likely to be running on very little health, forcing you to complete stages almost without taking a single hit just to reach the boss. The difficulty feels more frustrating than challenging, making the overall experience far less enjoyable.",
